# Base URL the app calls the API at. "/api" is same-origin: the Vite dev and
# preview servers proxy it to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts), which
# avoids CORS entirely. For a differently hosted backend, set an absolute URL.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Sign in with Google: the OAuth client id (Google Cloud console → APIs & Services →
# Credentials), the same value the backend is configured with. Public by design — a
# client id identifies the application, it does not authorise anything. Left empty,
# the "Continue with Google" button is not rendered at all and nothing is fetched
# from Google.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
